{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/audio/ovi-english-beginner-2026-06-10-playing-video-games.mp3","durationSec":130.128,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.3,"text":"People can play video games on different platforms."},{"start":3.08,"end":6.06,"text":"A platform is the place or device you use to play."},{"start":6.86,"end":8.08,"text":"A phone is easy to carry."},{"start":8.82,"end":10.86,"text":"A computer can be good for many online games."},{"start":11.6,"end":13.8,"text":"A console connects to a TV or screen."},{"start":14.54,"end":16.2,"text":"A tablet can feel simple and relaxed."},{"start":17.48,"end":18.88,"text":"Some people play for a short time."},{"start":19.4,"end":21.62,"text":"They play one quick game on the train or at home."},{"start":22.62,"end":24.36,"text":"Other people play for a longer time with friends."},{"start":32.52,"end":33.98,"text":"There are many kinds of games."},{"start":34.72,"end":37.94,"text":"In an action game, players move quickly and make fast choices."},{"start":39,"end":43.56,"text":"In a sports or racing game, players can play soccer, basketball, or car races."},{"start":44.54,"end":48.3,"text":"In an adventure game, players explore new places and find useful items."},{"start":49.34,"end":50.34,"text":"Real examples help."},{"start":78.18,"end":79.82,"text":"Some games are single-player games."},{"start":80.52,"end":81.54,"text":"One person plays alone."},{"start":82.28,"end":84.2,"text":"This can be good when you want quiet time."},{"start":85.04,"end":86.18,"text":"Some games are team games."},{"start":87.1,"end":90.28,"text":"Friends work together, talk, help each other, and make a plan."},{"start":91.1,"end":93.06,"text":"Playing with friends needs simple communication."},{"start":93.96,"end":99.08,"text":"Friends can choose the game, agree on the time, and decide if they want voice chat or short messages."},{"start":100.22,"end":103.6,"text":"Good game English is friendly, clear, and not too long."},{"start":104.36,"end":106.44,"text":"Friends do not always want the same game."},{"start":107.14,"end":109.7,"text":"One friend may want a fast game like Mario Kart."},{"start":110.16,"end":114.42,"text":"Another friend may want a calm game like Animal Crossing or a building game like Minecraft."},{"start":115.18,"end":118.9,"text":"It is useful to explain the reason, not only the game name."},{"start":119.44,"end":122.18,"text":"Friends can also make a small plan before they start."},{"start":122.82,"end":129.48,"text":"They choose the platform, choose the game type, choose the time, and choose one rule for playing safely."}],"words":[{"text":"people","start":0,"end":0.26},{"text":"can","start":0.26,"end":0.46},{"text":"play","start":0.46,"end":0.7},{"text":"video","start":0.7,"end":1.02},{"text":"games","start":1.02,"end":1.3},{"text":"on","start":1.3,"end":1.54},{"text":"different","start":1.54,"end":1.8},{"text":"platforms","start":1.8,"end":2.3},{"text":"a","start":3.08,"end":3.2},{"text":"platform","start":3.2,"end":3.54},{"text":"is","start":3.54,"end":3.88},{"text":"the","start":3.88,"end":4.02},{"text":"place","start":4.02,"end":4.36},{"text":"or","start":4.36,"end":4.72},{"text":"device","start":4.72,"end":5.06},{"text":"you","start":5.06,"end":5.44},{"text":"use","start":5.44,"end":5.66},{"text":"to","start":5.66,"end":5.84},{"text":"play","start":5.84,"end":6.06},{"text":"a","start":6.86,"end":6.92},{"text":"phone","start":6.92,"end":7.16},{"text":"is","start":7.16,"end":7.38},{"text":"easy","start":7.38,"end":7.54},{"text":"to","start":7.54,"end":7.78},{"text":"carry","start":7.78,"end":8.08},{"text":"a","start":8.82,"end":8.9},{"text":"computer","start":8.9,"end":9.22},{"text":"can","start":9.22,"end":9.52},{"text":"be","start":9.52,"end":9.64},{"text":"good","start":9.64,"end":9.8},{"text":"for","start":9.8,"end":9.98},{"text":"many","start":9.98,"end":10.18},{"text":"online","start":10.18,"end":10.42},{"text":"games","start":10.42,"end":10.86},